; ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
; HouseBurgherA — pilot "paper 2.5D" building (Cult of the Lamb technique)
; 3 flat art slices, tilted -40° to face the camera, stacked in depth (accordion).
; Each slice: QuadMesh + StandardMaterial3D (albedo + generated normal map,
; alpha-scissor so it writes depth -> correct occlusion/shadows).
; Art pipeline: docs/kingdom_plan.md §3 — PPU 0.0082, depth step 0.55.
; Tuning knobs: Visual.rotation_degrees.x (tilt), L2/L3 z offsets (accordion),
; mat_l*.normal_scale (light raking strength).
; ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

